WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:00.850
[Mużika ġentili tal-pjanu u l-orkestra]

00:00.850 --> 00:02.318
Din il-ħarifa.

00:04.400 --> 00:06.796
Jaf kemm kienu tajbin.

00:08.400 --> 00:10.542
Jaf il-lista tax-xewqat tagħhom.

00:14.250 --> 00:16.160
Jaf isimhom.

00:19.200 --> 00:22.236
Esperjenza lil Santa b’mod ġdid għalkollox.

00:23.000 --> 00:26.000
[Ħoss ħafif ta’ qanpiena. Qniepen tal-islitta.]
